      "cooked": "<p>Team,</p>\n<p>If the planned Qty to Manufacture is 3 and completed Qty is 2 , Job cards is not getting closed.</p>\n<p>is there a way that we can partial close the job cards for accepted quantity ?</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/7/9/79e887820cbc6dba9cc127d2bd3154f93dffc681.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/79e887820cbc6dba9cc127d2bd3154f93dffc681\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/7/9/79e887820cbc6dba9cc127d2bd3154f93dffc681_2_609x500.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"horXScgTPe9hxfbX6cfAdbMZ9i9\" width=\"609\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/7/9/79e887820cbc6dba9cc127d2bd3154f93dffc681_2_609x500.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/7/9/79e887820cbc6dba9cc127d2bd3154f93dffc681_2_913x750.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/7/9/79e887820cbc6dba9cc127d2bd3154f93dffc681.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"FAFAFA\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1006×825 33.6 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/0/6/06770eba36441c801c2ab9b37770330f59f3d1e8.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"VbWyhpx185uRehcxKAJtDk677G\" width=\"619\" height=\"307\"></p>",
